  "id": "decline-effect",
  "term": "decline effect",
  "definition": "In this packet, decline effect refers to a memory-related fading process in which earlier emotional experiences count less when they are carried forward into a cumulative emotional index. It describes how the influence of past rounds weakens over time in the model.",
